    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This is not related to this PR (i think typing in the original recommend library has the same limitation) \r\n\r\nBut for more correct typing, both `facetName` and `facetValue` have to be either set or not. We can't have one without the other or we will get an error: `Parameters 'facetName' and 'facetValue' must both be empty, or both be set`\r\n\r\nCould be a future improvement though.",
    "commit_id": "b83dac2101e0fcbabe91613790f88483785918c4",
    "created_at": "2024-04-29T15:48:44Z",
